title: A Hundred Acts Alone
subtitle: A proletarian hundred raids an arms store of the Black Reichswehr.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 6 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and red_guards_strength >= 5
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
var d = RG.target('guards');
Q.e23_alone_d = d;
Q.e23_alone_name = Q.sys_target_name;
Q.e23_alone_trade = Q.sys_target_trade;
Q.e23_alone_found = 0;
RG.district(d, {militancy: 4, repression: 4});
RG.news('Workers\' squad raids an arms store in ' + Q.e23_alone_name, 3);
!}

= A Hundred Acts Alone

In [+ e23_alone_name +] a hundred of [+ e23_alone_trade +] has acted without orders. On Saturday night forty of them drove out to a farm where the Black Reichswehr kept rifles under the hay, tied up the two guards and came back with three lorries of weapons. On Sunday they marched through the town with the rifles on their shoulders.

The police have asked Berlin for instructions. The hundred's leader, a sheet-metal worker who fought in the Red Army of the Ruhr in 1920, says he will give the rifles to the party and nobody else.

- @hide: Hide the rifles.
- @back: Back them in public.
- @return: Give the rifles back.

@hide
subtitle: The district secretary thinks the police will find them one time in three.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_alone = 2;
Q.e23_alone_found = Math.random() < 0.33 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_alone_found) {
    RG.district(Q.e23_alone_d, {repression: 10, guards: -1});
} else {
    Q.red_guards_arms += 6;
    RG.district(Q.e23_alone_d, {guards: 1});
}
!}

[? if e23_alone_found = 0 : The rifles go into a cellar whose address three people know. The police search the trade union house twice and find a duplicating machine. ?][? if e23_alone_found = 1 : A neighbour saw the lorries unload. The police find the cellar on Wednesday and take the rifles and eleven men. ?]

@back
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Other hundreds will go looking for hay barns. The police will come in force.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed formations.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('uprising');
Q.e23_alone = 1;
RG.district(Q.e23_alone_d, {guards: 1.5, militancy: 6, repression: 10, loyalty: 4});
Q.red_guards_arms += 3;
RG.ecci('bukharin', 4);
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

*Die Rote Fahne* prints a photograph of the march. Within a week hundreds in three other towns have raided farms of their own.

@return
subtitle: The courts and the SPD are satisfied. The hundred is not.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_alone = 3;
RG.district(Q.e23_alone_d, {guards: -1, loyalty: -8, repression: -4});
Q.spd_relation += 4;
!}

The rifles are left outside the police station in a handcart. The hundred's leader tears up his card in front of the district office.
